  "termsTermsText": "The app is free and non-profit and helps verified parents organise school runs by turns. Each parent is responsible for their own driving and for following traffic rules. The app takes no fee or commission. We may suspend an account that breaks these terms or the code of conduct. You can delete your account at any time.",
  "termsPrivacyText": "We collect what we need to verify parents, organise runs and keep them safe: your mobile number and email, then your ID photo, a selfie, your children's details and driving licences. Photos are stored encrypted in a private store while your account is open and deleted 1 year after you close it. We keep a summary of each run and a compressed route for 1 year for safety investigations; only admins see it, with a logged reason. We collect usage statistics without names, numbers or places, and you can switch them off. Other parents see only your first name, school, area and the Verified badge. We never sell your data. On the privacy screen you can see, correct, download and delete your data and withdraw any consent.",
  "termsConductText": "Respect other parents and the children. Keep to your times and tell the group early if you cannot drive. Do not share children's details or photos outside the group. Drive safely, with a seat belt for every child. Report any unsafe behaviour.",
